    "summary": "addRepo() calls proposeIgnoreFile before building the repo's FileFilter, so a repo added with no root ignore file has one before the first full index runs (688056149). Follow-up 66e0566c0 wires a real cheap-tier model (cheapTierIgnoreModel, built like the summariser's provider, resolved per call) into both daemon IndexerService construction sites; before it, production always wrote the fallback file."
